description: How tests are written in this repo
globs: backend/tests/**, frontend/src/**/__tests__/**
alwaysApply: false
---
# Tests

- Backend: async tests (asyncio_mode=auto). Fixtures in tests/conftest.py (`settings`,
  `app`, `client`). Override dependencies with `app.dependency_overrides`.
- Name tests as behaviour: `test_booking_overlapping_slot_is_rejected`.
- Per endpoint cover: success, validation (422), unauthenticated (401), forbidden (403),
  not found (404), conflict (409) where relevant. Assert Problem Details `status`/`type`.
- External services: inject fakes implementing the port Protocol. Never hit real APIs.
- Integration tests touching Postgres/Redis get `pytestmark = pytest.mark.integration`.
- Frontend: Vitest + Vue Test Utils; mock the `src/api` function, not axios internals;
  select elements by `data-testid`.
